    <string name="unlock_tip_title">Let your phone unlock itself</string>
    <string name="unlock_tip_body">Your agent had to wait for you to unlock the phone. With Extend Unlock or Smart Lock, unlock the phone once after it connects to a trusted Bluetooth device, like your car, a helmet intercom or a watch. It then stays unlocked while connected, for up to 4 hours. Tap to open security settings.</string>
