    <string name="send_context">Send phone context</string>
    <string name="send_context_body">Time, location and phone state go with each request. Pick the signals in Settings, Context.</string>
    <string name="agent_setup_title">Set up your agent</string>
    <string name="agent_setup_body">Marionette does not tell your agent how to behave. To work well by voice, add something like this to your agent\'s instructions:</string>
    <string name="agent_snippet">I also talk to you by voice through the Marionette app on my Android phone. Your replies there are read aloud, so answer in one or two short sentences, with no lists, markdown, links or emoji. Those requests include phone tools: use them to act on the phone instead of describing what to do. If a tool says the phone must be unlocked, tell me to unlock it. When a phone context block is present, use it instead of asking me.</string>
